WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.018
Week 30: Por, Para, Passive, and Impersonal Se. explain purpose and cause describe processes report institutional action

2
00:00:09.018 --> 00:00:16.841
Form and meaning. Por versus para; passive voice; passive and impersonal se; agent suppression and focus.

3
00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:44.870
Model set. La medida fue aprobada por el consejo. Se publicaron los resultados ayer. Trabajamos para mejorar el acceso. El servicio cerró por falta de fondos. Se requiere identificación para entrar. The measure was approved by the council. The results were published yesterday. We work to improve access. The service closed because of a lack of funding. Identification is required to enter.

4
00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:55.149
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:55.149 --> 00:01:08.501
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: explain purpose and cause; describe processes; report institutional action. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:37.255
Model language. La medida fue aprobada por el consejo. — The measure was approved by the council. Se publicaron los resultados ayer. — The results were published yesterday. Trabajamos para mejorar el acceso. — We work to improve access. El servicio cerró por falta de fondos. — The service closed because of a lack of funding. Se requiere identificación para entrar. — Identification is required to enter.

7
00:01:37.255 --> 00:01:47.259
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
